353
01:10:26,072 --> 01:10:26,492
Tamam.

354
01:10:28,271 --> 01:10:29,211
Dersiyle hocam.

355
01:10:30,731 --> 01:10:31,092
Güzel.

356
01:10:31,431 --> 01:10:32,492
